@host = {{$dotenv DB_HOST}}
@port = {{$dotenv APP_PORT}}
@server = http://{{host}}:{{port}}/admin

### Only users with role set to "admin" can run these
### Make sure to double check that the luid is of a user that is an admin
### uid = user being changed -> sometimes in the url, not body

### Get all users
POST {{server}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "luid": 4
}

### Get specific user
GET {{server}}/5
Content-Type: application/json

### Deny user
PATCH {{server}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "uid": 5,
    "luid": 4
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{server}}/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "luid": 4
}